# ============================================================================
#   GOD'S EYE VIEW - FREE EDITION  -  API KEYS
# ============================================================================
#
#   HOW TO USE THIS FILE  (it opens in Notepad)
#
#     1. Pick a section below and open its link in your web browser.
#     2. Sign up (it is free) and copy the key.
#     3. Paste it right AFTER the "=" sign.  No quotes.  No spaces.
#          GOOD:   GEMINI_API_KEY=AIzaSy...
#          BAD:    GEMINI_API_KEY = "AIzaSy..."
#     4. Save the file (Ctrl+S), close Notepad, then RESTART the app:
#        close the black window and run START-HERE-WINDOWS.bat again.
#
#   YOU DO NOT NEED EVERY KEY.  With no keys at all you still get the
#   satellite globe, live flights, military flights, satellites, earthquakes,
#   radio, public cameras, transit, bike share and more.  Each key below
#   unlocks ONE extra thing.  Start with 1 and 2, add the rest whenever.
#
#   (You can also skip this file: the POWER UP button inside the app has the
#   same keys, the same links, and restarts the app for you.)
#
#   YOUR KEYS STAY ON THIS COMPUTER.  They are only ever sent to the company
#   that issued them.  This file is never uploaded anywhere.  Do not share
#   it, post it, or show it on screen.
# ============================================================================


# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  1.  PHOTOREALISTIC 3D CITIES + WORLD TERRAIN        Cesium ion  -  FREE
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  Without it: you get the flat satellite globe (still works).
#
#    a) Make a free account ........ https://cesium.com/ion   (click Sign Up)
#    b) Add the 3D tiles (do this ONCE - the globe stays flat without it):
#         https://ion.cesium.com/assetdepot
#         search  Google Photorealistic 3D Tiles  ->  "Add to my assets"
#    c) Copy your token ............ https://ion.cesium.com/tokens
#         (your "Default Access Token" is fine)  and paste it below.
#
#  The free plan is for personal, non-commercial use.  Limits (Cesium's
#  numbers, they can change): 15 GB streaming and 1,000 Google 3D sessions a
#  month - roughly one session each time you open the app.
CESIUM_ION_TOKEN=


# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  2.  VOICE CONTROL - talk to the planet               Google Gemini  -  FREE
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  Without it: everything works except the microphone.
#
#    Get it ........ https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
#                    (sign in with Google -> "Create API key" -> copy it)
#
#  No credit card.  The free plan has per-minute and per-day limits that
#  Google can change.  Use: click MIC, or hold SPACE and talk.
#
#  PRIVACY - READ THIS:  on Google's free tier, Google may use what you say
#  (and the map view details sent with it) to improve its products, and human
#  reviewers may read it.  Do not say anything private.  A paid Google plan
#  turns that off.
GEMINI_API_KEY=


# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  3.  AI SUMMARY LINE (the five-word readout in the HUD)    Groq  -  FREE
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  Without it: the HUD shows a plain built-in summary line instead.
#
#    Get it ........ https://console.groq.com/keys
#                    (sign up -> "Create API Key" -> copy it)
GROQ_API_KEY=


# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  4.  LIVE SHIPS WORLDWIDE                               AISStream  -  FREE
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  Without it: the ships layer stays empty.
#
#    Get it ........ https://aisstream.io   (click "Sign in with GitHub" -
#                    you need a free GitHub account)
#                    then open https://aisstream.io/account and create a key.
AISSTREAM_API_KEY=


# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  5.  LIVE WILDFIRES                                     NASA FIRMS  -  FREE
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  Without it: the fires layer shows "KEY REQUIRED".
#
#    Get it ........ https://firms.modaps.eosdis.nasa.gov/api/map_key/
#                    enter your email -> the key arrives by email
#                    (check your spam folder).
FIRMS_MAP_KEY=


# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  6.  LIVE TRAFFIC COLORS                                TomTom  -  FREE
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  Without it: cars still drive on real roads using a built-in simulation.
#
#    Get it ........ https://my.tomtom.com/keys
#                    (sign up, then copy "My first API key".  If it asks which
#                    APIs to turn on, tick the Traffic ones.)
#
#  Free = 200,000 map-tile requests per month, no credit card.  The line
#  below makes the app stop asking TomTom after that many tiles in one day, so
#  normal use stays inside the free allowance.  It is a safety limit, not a
#  guarantee - TomTom's own meter is the one that counts.
TOMTOM_API_KEY=
TOMTOM_DAILY_TILE_BUDGET=6000


# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  7.  MORE FLIGHT DATA (optional)                        OpenSky  -  FREE
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  Without it: flights still work (anonymous = fewer requests per day, and the
#  app falls back to another free flight source when OpenSky says "slow down").
#
#    a) Register / log in ........ https://opensky-network.org
#    b) Open your account ........ https://opensky-network.org/my-opensky/account
#         -> find "API client" -> create one.  A file called credentials.json
#         downloads.  The secret is ONLY in that file - it is not shown again.
#    c) Open credentials.json in Notepad.  Copy clientId and clientSecret
#       into the two lines below.
#
#  Leave the first line as it is.
OPENSKY_AUTH_MODE=auto
OPENSKY_CLIENT_ID=
OPENSKY_CLIENT_SECRET=


# ============================================================================
#   ADVANCED  -  most people never touch anything below this line
# ============================================================================

# The app opens at  http://localhost:4173   Change the number if it is taken.
PORT=4173

# The app only listens on THIS computer by default, which is the safe choice:
# it brokers your keys, so anyone who can reach it could spend your quota.
# To share it on your home network, remove the # on the next line.
# WARNING: that lets everyone on that network use your keys.
# HOST=0.0.0.0

# Optional per-IP request limits (requests per minute) for the voice / AI
# summary and map-place endpoints.  Only useful if you set HOST=0.0.0.0 above.
# These are NOT a billing cap: set budget limits at the provider (Google AI
# Studio / Groq / Google Cloud billing) if you want a hard spending ceiling.
# GEV_RATELIMIT_VOICE_PER_MIN=30
# GEV_RATELIMIT_GOOGLE_PER_MIN=60

# ---- OpenStreetMap "Overpass" servers: NOT used unless you list some here.
# ---- Road traffic (OpenFreeMap / TomTom), ALPR cameras (an hourly OpenStreetMap
# ---- extract), state/country outlines and named building outlines (Nominatim)
# ---- all work without them.  Only the Mapped Installations layer and outlines
# ---- of unnamed buildings need one.  Use only instances you run or are allowed
# ---- to use; the public ones refuse this app.  Comma-separated URLs:
# OVERPASS_UPSTREAMS=

# ---- Optional: local ADS-B decoder feeds (your own 1090/978 MHz receiver) for
# ---- the Local ADS-B layer.  Comma-separated band=url entries; each host must
# ---- be this computer or your home network; the path ends in aircraft.json.
# ---- See docs/LOCAL-RECEIVERS.md.
# LOCAL_RECEIVER_FEEDS=1090=http://localhost:8080/data/aircraft.json,978=http://localhost:8978/data/aircraft.json

# ---- Optional: which other web pages may show the app inside a frame
# ---- (?embed=1), e.g. https://example.com - or * for any page.  Unset, none.
# GEV_EMBED_FRAME_ANCESTORS=

# ---- Optional: your own Google Maps key (NOT needed) ------------------------
# The seven free keys above already cover everything.  If you happen to have a
# Google Maps Platform key, the app can use it for Google's own 3D tiles and
# place data instead.  It needs a Google Cloud BILLING account (a card on
# file) and Google charges beyond its free monthly allowance - leave these two
# lines alone if you are not sure.
#   https://developers.google.com/maps/documentation/tile/get-api-key
# GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=
# GOOGLE_MAPS_SERVER_API_KEY=